                            <input type="text" data-prepend="Date of Birth:" data-validate="required" id="GetDoB" name="GetDoB" value="@Model.DoB" autocomplete="off" data-role="calendarpicker" data-cls-calendar="compact" @*data-format="%d/%m/%Y"*@ data-input-format="%d/%m/%Y">
